to-date knowledge in subject area to meet deadlines; follows procedures and policies, and applies data and resources to support projects or initiatives with limited guidance and/or sponsorship. Collaborates with others to solve business problems; escalates issues or risks as appropriate; communicates progress and information. Supports the completion of priorities, deadlines, and expectations. Identifies and speaks up for ways to address improvement opportunities.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Manages small projects or components of larger projects with oversight from more senior project managers. Develop and executes project plans independently or under the direction of others. Assists with project financials by monitoring financial aspects for assigned project initiatives. Monitors project performance (e.g., on time, on budget, within scope, and with quality) against plan under the guidance of from more senior project managers. Assists with project activities related to organizational change management (e.g., development and execution of user adoption, implementation, and training plans) as defined by the project. Allocates resources, establishes schedules, and makes task assignments.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Leads the work of project team members with guidance from more senior project managers. Requests internal or external resources to support completion of project activities and changes in schedule, scope, and budget. Promotes project vision and objectives with project team.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Supports the management and proactive mitigation of project issues and risks by assisting in the analysis and resolution of trigger events.","sour